# Trial-Size Trial by Lightning (battlefield.trial_size_trial_by_lightning): entryRequirement. Main, a level 20 Warrior with the quest accepted and
# the MiniTuningForkOfLightning: LP_Entrance: not a Summoner: no options: the default. bob, a level 19 Summoner: below 20: no options.
lists CloisterOfStorms/LP_Entrance/onTrade
char zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=533.5,-14.9,492.0 job=WAR lvl=20
char bob zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=533.5,-14.9,492.0 job=SMN lvl=19
quest OtherAreas.TrialSizeTrialByLightning accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfLightning
bob: item MiniTuningForkOfLightning
login
trade LP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfLightning x1  # not a Summoner: no options
bob: login
bob: trade LP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfLightning x1  # level 19: no options
